  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1085\">\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1085\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1052\">Clue Cells</strong> suggest <em data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1082\">Bacterial Vaginosis</em>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1135\">\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1135\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1103\">Yeast Cells</strong> indicate <em data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1132\">Candida infection</em>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1191\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1153\">Trichomonas</strong> presence confirms <em data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1188\">Trichomoniasis</em>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1296\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1210\">Lactobacilli</strong> are part of normal vaginal flora; their depletion may suggest infection or imbalance.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1327\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1327\">Clinical Use:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1498\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1427\">\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1427\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1368\">common vaginal infections</strong> like Bacterial Vaginosis, Candidiasis, and Trichomoniasis.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1498\">\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1498\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Assists in evaluating <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1497\">vaginal discharge, itching, or discomfort</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
